            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The increase in arylsulphatase activity in the ischemic zone has been shown by histochemical method in progressing acute myocardial ischemia. The increase in the enzyme activity in a so-called &quot;intact&quot; zone was less marked.</AbstractText>
